{"title":"2018 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2018 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A five-digit integer is made using each of the digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The integer is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/4/6e41aa105edab8540a4f4e745f811f438e56af55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> and less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/4/b0418659a3bfa4f3ee45aa64f19613f62f171930.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$92~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />. The units (ones) digit is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The hundreds and tens digits, in that order, form a two-digit integer that is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. What is the five-digit integer?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since we already know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the units digit, we know that the number must be of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/c/49c54cab8dbae357562947d4de91784acec163d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{ABCD3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/0/ce0bfc603f9a044e308b1a1fdadca917e81ad2dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{CD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> to be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/b/a0b77255482ff52af1908271b2622a2fe3eaa53d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/9/0591b54746d40d0a11da8371abcdd49096e31b4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> cannot equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because all the digits must be odd, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/9/0591b54746d40d0a11da8371abcdd49096e31b4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Because the number is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/1/4613d62e2dfbc12cb5c35b4adaae4ac448fce1f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$82~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c961038c0307729c41af17b04fa3bd600e971527.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/d/84d17034b6a616dd13911082664bc2fc9734f096.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />. However, all of the digits must be odd, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/d/84d17034b6a616dd13911082664bc2fc9734f096.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />. This means that the number must be more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/d/fad0ed14ae31ccd763b657937f479e95c5fd9029.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> but less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/4/b0418659a3bfa4f3ee45aa64f19613f62f171930.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$92~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c85145af0b6431672968299c4d2f016270e22caf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 0$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/e/27eafbc6b227604e3fdc435dc9806839fadced95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is odd, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/e/27eafbc6b227604e3fdc435dc9806839fadced95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>All remaining digits have been used up except <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddf96892e4c0821f127102dee41517a58d9086cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = 7$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Combining everything, the number must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/c/76cab52de16857d0110071c3038b286b51e01852.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{91753}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"59\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018005244\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 151/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7057/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.864      1 2018_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    5.864      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35979:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018005244 and revision id 279550. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}